  1.5,
  'road',
  '["JAAF"]',
  '淀川河川敷の全長10kmの周回コース。全てフラットな高速コースで、高低差は1.5m以内。',
  'A 10 km loop course along the Yodo River. The course is entirely flat and fast, with an elevation difference of 1.5 m or less.',
